  "description": "<p>⭐ <strong>Bustronome London: Dinner</strong>&nbsp;combines sightseeing, fine dining, and an innovative audio guide on board, making it a one-of-a-kind experience.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Ticket types</strong><br>\n🎫 Adult (18+) - Full Wine Pairing, with 1 glass of champagne + 4 glasses of wine<br>\n🎫 Adult (13+) - No Drinks<br>\n🎫 Child (4-12)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n💂 Enjoy a panoramic sightseeing experience on Bustronome's double-decker bus while passing by the iconic London landmarks<br>\n🍴 Indulge in a six-course dinner showcasing the local flavors from a seasonal menu that also offers a vegan option<br>\n📚 Explore the history of London with an innovative audio guide that provides commentary in 8 different languages during the tour</p>\n\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Date: various dates available (select during purchase)<br>\n🕒 Time: 7:15 p.m.<br>\n⏳ Duration: approximatly 3 hours<br>\n📍 Location: Bustronome London</p>\n\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nGet ready for the ultimate London adventure with Bustronome! Treat your taste buds to a scrumptious 6-course meal, infused with the perfect blend of Anglo-French flavors. But that's not all! Indulge in breathtaking views of iconic landmarks like Big Ben and St. Paul's Cathedral! And as if that weren't enough, you'll also get to enjoy a fascinating audio guide, filled with content that'll blow your mind. And guess what? You can even bring along your furry friend! Don't miss out on a night of wonder, as this extraordinary experience is one for the books, get your tickets now for&nbsp;Bustronome London: Dinner!</p>",
